sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Platform Admin
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Operator as Operator Manager<br/>/manager
    participant Reconciler as LLMBatchGateway<br/>Reconciler
    participant Helm as Helm Chart<br/>Renderer
    participant TLS as SecurityProfile<br/>Watcher
    participant SecSync as Secret<br/>Synchronizer
    participant MetricsCtrl as Metrics<br/>Controller
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>Scraper

    Note over Admin,Prometheus: Control Plane Loop

    Admin->>K8s: kubectl apply LLMBatchGateway CR<br/>(batch.llm-d.ai/v1alpha1)
    K8s-->>Operator: Watch event: LLMBatchGateway created/updated
    Operator->>Reconciler: Enqueue reconcile

    Reconciler->>TLS: Get cluster TLS profile
    TLS->>K8s: Read OpenShift APIServer CR
    K8s-->>TLS: TLS profile (Intermediate default)
    TLS-->>Reconciler: Cipher suites + min TLS version

    Reconciler->>Helm: Render batch-gateway chart<br/>(images from env vars, TLS profile)
    Helm-->>Reconciler: Rendered manifests
    Reconciler->>K8s: Create/Update Deployments,<br/>Services, ConfigMaps, SAs

    Reconciler->>Helm: Render async-processor chart<br/>(images from env vars, TLS profile)
    Helm-->>Reconciler: Rendered manifests
    Reconciler->>K8s: Create/Update Deployments,<br/>ConfigMaps, SAs

    Note over Reconciler,K8s: Conditional Resources (if CRDs present)

    Reconciler->>K8s: Create HTTPRoute (Gateway API)
    Reconciler->>K8s: Create Certificate (cert-manager)
    Reconciler->>K8s: Create ServiceMonitor, PodMonitor

    Note over SecSync,K8s: Secret Synchronization

    K8s-->>SecSync: Watch event: Secret changed
    SecSync->>K8s: Check ReferenceGrant
    K8s-->>SecSync: Grant approved
    SecSync->>K8s: Copy Secret cross-namespace

    Note over MetricsCtrl,Prometheus: Metrics & Monitoring

    MetricsCtrl->>K8s: Create metrics Service (ClusterIP :8443)
    MetricsCtrl->>K8s: Create ServiceMonitor
    MetricsCtrl->>K8s: Create PrometheusRule<br/>(reconcile errors, leader election alerts)

    Prometheus->>Operator: GET :8443/metrics<br/>Bearer Token
    Operator->>K8s: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
    K8s-->>Operator: Authenticated & Authorized
    Operator-->>Prometheus: Metrics response (HTTPS)

    Note over TLS,Operator: TLS Profile Change Detection

    TLS->>K8s: Watch APIServer CR
    K8s-->>TLS: TLS profile changed
    TLS->>Operator: Trigger graceful restart
